{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>32歲「大馬女神」Miko黃潔琪今年初與前經理人爆出嚴重工作分歧，無預警宣佈全面終止合作關係。面對突如其來的演藝事業危機，她未有退縮反而親自上陣接洽工作並作出反擊。這場合約風波背後隱藏的後續發展，讓她以驚人姿態寫下連續四年登陸賀歲大銀幕罕見紀錄。</p><p>黃潔琪捲入合約糾紛無預警切割</p><p>今年4月23日清晨，Miko黃潔琪突然透過社交平台發表嚴正聲明，宣佈正式結束與前經理人蔡佩樺合作關係。雙方在演藝規劃、合作模式以及商業發展方向上產生嚴重分歧，無法達成共識而走向決裂。事件發生期間正值她需要兼顧繁重演藝工作時刻，她隨即進行權限切割，親自接管並重新安排自己的事業發展步伐。</p><p>取消代理權限親自接洽演藝工作</p><p>針對這場風波，Miko黃潔琪在聲明中明確指出即日起全面取消前經理人代表其接洽任何活動、廣告與商務報價權限。她強調對方再無權以其名義對外發表聲明或做出商業決定，並表示會對未經授權商業行為保留法律追究權利。為了確保工作順利過渡，她宣佈未來所有邀約改由本人或親自授權窗口直接聯繫，親自掌握工作主導權。</p><p>2024年《龍龍龍龍龍》首度進軍賀歲檔市場</p><figure><img alt=\"Happy-Dragons-2024-Movie-Film.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894162342214439_20791690416aa11537e7d59.jpg\"/><figcaption>Happy-Dragons-2024-Movie-Film.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>2025年《阿媽有喜》飾演袁詠儀女兒惹關注</p><figure><img alt=\"Kuc8D3ET0AW_CUz0fbfzVe02pO3toqYBH68X8x-vF_M.jpeg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17889416249712452_89859976aa11539d399c.jpg\"/><figcaption>Kuc8D3ET0AW_CUz0fbfzVe02pO3toqYBH68X8x-vF_M.jpeg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"aMmA4ZdzVBa9WWU50Pnpq5XPDqlQ8YnyT8xO8U_MTvE.jpeg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894162736822485_11635631226aa1153c32666.jpg\"/><figcaption>aMmA4ZdzVBa9WWU50Pnpq5XPDqlQ8YnyT8xO8U_MTvE.jpeg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YtaOOqnqavT9qpB4BykZ4gHpcuwhZkv_cgaeWXIGnlk.jpeg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894163071096287_17665643266aa1153f11fd0.jpg\"/><figcaption>YtaOOqnqavT9qpB4BykZ4gHpcuwhZkv_cgaeWXIGnlk.jpeg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>2026年《夜王》化身夜總會小姐展現好身材</p><figure><img alt=\"夜王 miko （圖片來源：《夜王》海報）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176795012957415402_11461201576960c7321cd9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>夜王 miko （圖片來源：《夜王》海報）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夜王 miko （圖片來源：《夜王》海報）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177097479196574024_769623865698eee482d4b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>夜王 miko （圖片來源：《夜王》海報）</figcaption></figure><p>《黃金囍事》攜手四大視帝同場飆戲</p><figure><img alt=\"6127358902241268132.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894163221990819_19214045116aa115409c3f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>6127358902241268132.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6127358902241268133.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17889416334594866_21335612336aa115420ee2c.jpg\"/><figcaption>6127358902241268133.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ASTRO_4592.JPG/6115x4077_q90.jpg\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894163521562010_14383634516aa115441fd74.jpg\"/><figcaption>ASTRO_4592.JPG/6115x4077_q90.jpg</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ASTRO_4597.JPG/6433x4289_q90.jpg\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894165109927625_18084423416aa11554957d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>ASTRO_4597.JPG/6433x4289_q90.jpg</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ASTRO_4630.JPG/5514x3676_q90.jpg\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894167249293091_1281686906aa1156929f1d.jpg\"/><figcaption>ASTRO_4630.JPG/5514x3676_q90.jpg</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ASTRO_4699.JPG/5656x3771_q90.jpg\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894168097642216_12225914816aa11571ed534.jpg\"/><figcaption>ASTRO_4699.JPG/5656x3771_q90.jpg</figcaption></figure><p>網民大讚黃潔琪洗脫翻版林明禎</p><figure><img alt=\"夜王 miko 就算今次的泳裝相對密實，都依然包唔住Miko的驚人身材！（圖片來源：ig@mikowong）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/image-688872_20184679966c5a86e4c71b-819x1024.jpeg\"/><figcaption>夜王 miko 就算今次的泳裝相對密實，都依然包唔住Miko的驚人身材！（圖片來源：ig@mikowong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1784947270_3948746103396306779_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894169342491501_16288491166aa1157e17b12.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1784947270_3948746103396306779_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1784947270_3948746113009707963_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894169752391266_1469400546aa11582264f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1784947270_3948746113009707963_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1784947270_3948746124594310989_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894170214344958_19075054806aa11586c096d.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1784947270_3948746124594310989_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1771039765_3832078998747408349_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894170495153988_4911336436aa1158985de2.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1771039765_3832078998747408349_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1788318704_3977027971317219836_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894170696994661_18650854656aa1158b6b1e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1788318704_3977027971317219836_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1788318704_3977027968423036208_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178894171118864335_1838941176aa1158fb8728.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1788318704_3977027968423036208_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T08:20:43.411740+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1576,"images":19,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}